\section{Event-Drift Timeline Classification}
Regimes are classified based on curvature, acceleration, and stress trends.

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Warped}: unstable curvature + rising stress
    \item \textbf{Stable}: bounded stress + consistent dynamics
    \item \textbf{Accelerating}: monotonic increase in anomaly strength
\end{itemize}

