\section{Execution Workflow}
\begin{enumerate}
    \item Load tensor field and initialize particle states.
    \item Define tensegrity structure and coupling parameters.
    \item Run Hamiltonian integration using a symplectic method.
    \item Compute structural stress each timestep.
    \item Classify regime every $N$ steps.
    \item Export trajectory, stress curve, and regime timeline.
\end{enumerate}

